forged-kit-unbranded-burntender-name = Burn Tender
forged-kit-unbranded-burntender-description = Patch up the next recruit before the forge claims them. Contains 1 gauze stack, 1 burn ointment stack, 1 stimpak, 1 9mm pistol, 1 box of 9mm ammunition, 1 raider bandolier.
forged-kit-unbranded-brandbreaker-name = Brand Breaker
forged-kit-unbranded-brandbreaker-description = Earn your place with scrap iron and bruised knuckles. Contains 1 crowbar, 1 sledgehammer, 1 gauze stack, 1 burn ointment stack, 1 Psycho syringe, 1 raider bandolier.
forged-kit-unbranded-furnacebreacher-name = Furnace Breacher
forged-kit-unbranded-furnacebreacher-description = Your first breach begins with buckshot and a burning bottle. Contains 1 pump-action shotgun, 1 box of 12-gauge shells, 1 Molotov, 1 lighter, 1 raider bandolier.
forged-kit-branded-brandbreaker-name = Brand Breaker
forged-kit-branded-brandbreaker-description = Let the mark on your chest speak through every swing. Contains 1 decorated war club, 1 throwing knife, 1 Psycho syringe, 1 gauze stack, 1 burn ointment stack, 1 raider bandolier.
forged-kit-branded-scrapmauler-name = Scrap Mauler
forged-kit-branded-scrapmauler-description = Steel in your hands, spikes on your fists, and no room to back down. Contains 1 sledgehammer, 1 crowbar, 1 pair of spiked brass knuckles, 1 gauze stack, 1 burn ointment stack, 1 raider bandolier.
forged-kit-branded-closequarters-name = Close Quarters
forged-kit-branded-closequarters-description = Close the distance before they have time to fear the flames. Contains 1 pump-action shotgun, 1 box of 12-gauge shells, 1 combat knife, 1 Molotov, 1 lighter, 1 raider bandolier.
forged-kit-tempered-burntender-name = Burn Tender
forged-kit-tempered-burntender-description = Keep the raiding party alive through smoke, fire, and shattered cover. Contains 1 N14 medical kit, 1 gauze stack, 1 burn ointment stack, 1 American-180, 1 spare American-180 drum magazine, 1 box of .22 LR ammunition, 3 smoke grenades, 1 pair of night vision goggles, 1 N14 health scanner, 3 burn mesh stacks, 3 suture stacks, 1 CPR training book, 1 raider bandolier.
forged-kit-tempered-furnacesurgeon-name = Furnace Surgeon
forged-kit-tempered-furnacesurgeon-description = Set the tools down only when the shooting starts. Contains 1 surgical belt stocked with surgical tools, an N14 scanner and ethanol, 1 sterile mask, 1 9mm pistol, 1 box of 9mm ammunition, 1 sawed-off shotgun, 1 box of 12-gauge shells, 3 burn mesh stacks, 3 suture stacks, 1 CPR training book, 1 raider bandolier.
forged-kit-tempered-combatmedic-name = Combat Medic
forged-kit-tempered-combatmedic-description = Reach the wounded under fire and leave nobody useful behind. Contains 1 10mm pistol, 1 10mm SMG, 1 spare 10mm SMG magazine, 1 box of 10mm ammunition, 2 N14 combat medkits, 2 stimpaks, 1 gauze stack, 1 burn ointment stack, 1 N14 health scanner, 3 burn mesh stacks, 3 suture stacks, 1 CPR training book, 1 raider bandolier.
forged-kit-forged-flamebearer-name = Flamebearer
forged-kit-forged-flamebearer-description = Carry the furnace in your blade and settle the survivors with heavy lead. Contains 1 Shishkebab, 1 hunting revolver, 1 box of .45-70 ammunition, 2 loaded .45-70 speedloaders, 1 burn ointment stack, 1 raider bandolier.
forged-kit-forged-furnacebreacher-name = Furnace Breacher
forged-kit-forged-furnacebreacher-description = Turn defended rooms into ash and broken barricades. Contains 1 7.62mm marksman carbine, 2 spare 7.62mm rifle magazines, 1 box of 7.62mm ammunition, 2 Molotovs, 1 lighter, 1 raider bandolier.
forged-kit-forged-ashstorm-name = Ashstorm
forged-kit-forged-ashstorm-description = Sweep their cover with rifle fire, then let Embercleaver finish the work. Contains 1 R91 assault rifle, 2 spare 5.56mm rifle magazines, 1 box of 5.56mm ammunition, 1 Embercleaver machete, 1 gauze stack, 1 burn ointment stack, 1 raider bandolier.
